{"_id":"68a736128ec3d8323af14771","roadmapSlug":"data-analyst","nodeId":"n3M49lgNPn28hm7kzki-a","createdAt":"2025-08-21T15:06:58.099Z","description":"# ggplot2\n\nggplot2 is R's most popular visualization library, based on the Grammar of Graphics framework. Plots are built by layering geometric elements (points, lines, bars) on top of aesthetic mappings (x, y, color, size). It produces clean, professional-looking charts with minimal code and is the standard for data visualization in R.","resources":[{"type":"article","title":"ggplot2 website","url":"https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/","_id":"6a7f4a4fcb44947debcf59de"},{"type":"video","title":"Make beautiful graphs in R","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qnw1xDnt_Ec","_id":"6a7f4a4fcb44947debcf59df"}],"updatedAt":"2026-08-14T17:03:11.488Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[{"_id":"6a8894ecaca636c6b9e973f1","title":"DataCamp - Associate Data Analyst in SQL","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/1GK1qD"},{"_id":"6a5e04dcfb5fcb94d041675b","title":"DataCamp - Data Analyst with Python","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/AgYmJK"},{"_id":"6a5e189a077863512aba4c73","title":"roadmap.sh - Master SQL","partner":"roadmap.sh","type":"course","url":"https://roadmap.sh/courses/sql"}],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/data-analyst/content/n3M49lgNPn28hm7kzki-a.md"}